{"synopsis":"Arhan, yang kehilangan segalanya di tangan seorang Sword Master bahkan tanpa memahami satu kata pun darinya.\n\nDi tengah keputusasaan yang terasa seperti kematian, leluhur yang selama ini hanya hidup dalam legenda—Liam Karavan—menampakkan diri di hadapannya.\n\nMetode balas dendam satu-satunya yang ditawarkan Liam kepada Arhan hanyalah satu.\n\n“Telan pedang itu, dan jadikan kekuatan yang bersemayam di dalamnya sebagai milikmu sendiri.”\n\nSejak saat itu, balas dendam bocah bernama Arhan pun dimulai,\ndan nama keluarga yang telah terlupakan—‘Karavan’—perlahan terbangun kembali.","alternative_title":"검 먹는 소드마스터","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"cd965bf3-add4-416c-a9db-ef6125ccff99","date":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"6e2c08c0-58fd-4834-90cf-11a0128f7254","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"0d3f920b-e73f-4872-9132-94b6fdd60a93","date":"2026-07-14","images":[]},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"4e0ea961-dec0-46c0-8874-d5d8e3eb8b4d","date":"2026-07-07","images":[]},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"aee7e956-54a0-4256-90cb-75fe81902418","date":"2026-07-03","images":[]},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"83364727-dbd6-4b52-b781-dd9b2ffe5eb6","date":"2026-06-24","images":[]},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"b001eb87-adad-47b3-846f-835813d9e1a3","date":"2026-06-16","images":[]},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"130bae27-ffa2-4b3d-8f0a-848dc913ad37","date":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"8c5434c4-6222-4726-8bf5-da99a054880f","date":"2026-06-03","images":[]},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"8a82e0b0-7ee9-4c83-af86-9aa475fab013","date":"2026-05-27","images":[]},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"a2da1227-de41-4974-a165-555059dc1be9","date":"2026-05-20","images":[]},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"a9c68eb6-1673-4160-b9b5-e308f49d680f","date":"2026-05-17","images":[]},{"numbe